","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1026","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[71,72,53,74,60,62],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004602","armor":"WP1008505","helmet":"WP1023305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1002","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[71,72,53,74,60,62],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004602","armor":"WP1008505","helmet":"WP1023305"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"曹操部下将领，常山人，赵云发小。东汉末年，随夏侯惇在博望与刘备军交战时被俘虏。赵云请求饶过夏侯兰性命，又因夏侯兰明于法律，于是推荐他做了刘备军的军正，掌军事刑法。","tc":"曹操部下將領，常山人，趙云發小。東漢末年，隨夏侯惇在博望與劉備軍交戰時被俘虜。趙云請求饒過夏侯蘭性命，又因夏侯蘭明于法律，于是推薦他做了劉備軍的軍正，掌軍事刑法。","en":"A general under Cao Cao, hailing from Changshan and a childhood friend of Zhao Yun. In the late Eastern Han, he was captured while fighting under Xiahou Dun against Liu Bei's forces at Bowang. Zhao Yun pleaded for his life, and because Xiahou Lan was well-versed in military law, Zhao Yun recommended him as Military Judge in Liu Bei's army, overseeing military justice.","jp":"曹操配下の将。常山の人で、趙雲の幼馴染。後漢末、夏侯惇に従って博望で劉備軍と交戦した際に捕虜となった。趙雲が夏侯蘭の助命を請い、また夏侯蘭が法律に明るかったことから推薦を受け、劉備軍の軍正となって軍の刑法を司った。","kr":"조조 수하의 장수로 상산 사람이며, 조운의 어릴 적 동무이다. 동한 말년, 하후돈을 따라 박망에서 유비군과 교전하다 포로로 잡혔다. 조운이 하후란의 구명을 청하였고, 법률에 밝다는 점을 들어 유비군의 군정(軍正)으로 천거하여 군의 형법을 관장하게 했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10775","remark":"","surname":"夏侯","surnameTc":"夏侯","surnameEn":"Xiahou","surnameJp":"夏侯","surnameKr":"하후","surnameOther":"","name":"兰","nameTc":"蘭","nameEn":"Lan","nameJp":"蘭","nameKr":"란","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"夏侯兰","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0",